{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1539,
  "batch_count": 1711,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d25ece0757aaa73613c5e413f9fcfb8770c034dd",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7864e216d26b6811b83313d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "调整没有问题。\r\n日积月累的训练\r\n会直接化为力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "877d8567ba74c77b8c3fc012406bd5852ee38b24ef65d42415d1512052b68982",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02ffb6e3a45f5507ad1dc11a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态不差。\r\n总之别太用力，保持平静……\r\n不，应该说，不要太在意",
      "source_fingerprint": "828729629765b4aa795ce5b76eeaa317a6821b196e7928bd9b6186c73f02b312",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38721c7e58fe4fc366c07ba1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "调整没能赶上，不过……\r\n不能，辜负期待……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80fa723dd9ba7b3fb841ed6ddcad40ea064df57a2e35e3701b9f6e5aba686db9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bdbcf932b36ce353adde7a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……呼……。\r\n稍微……有些紧绷。\r\n必须在正式比赛前调整好……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02d69db4c81dcda985fbf8b38780fe8d6bc3620478d8307ca019827bf578530b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9488708b4662fbca04594fa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "注意力，稍微有些乱……\r\n努力不会背叛我。……应该如此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b505681698d341273249ceb57f3b2e960f12316cb10596f4d8cc03c67a457edd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:798056fde0689945b670d181",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使状态没有调整好，\r\n正式比赛也不会等我……。\r\n――即使，不完美。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cf2c0c9b1dc51d708a2e934b7e821ad239d7806220e9ef3f4845c920bc01fe1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:404037f08f6ad09d77c621e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……必须，交出成绩。\r\n不能，辱没家族的名字……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1910e2c8ef21ab70f2cfe6d02621576f5457d93ef04dba7b2f01f5769ba55ca0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92a634eddeeebbf979e5367d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不能，交出不争气的成绩。\r\n无论如何……绝对……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "302e56c7d6f9c97f3801582baa938fcaa3026fab33eefac4bb887371a126724b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1042bfacfa2a8e3a62aa9ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "987facfa0bd632334d8a05553b9672e89a8a7394f0bec63972d3ebacb7853c88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2814a20bca541a09436d09fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "了解。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0157e6aed55c5c02d6a5db10de6381ff48cf5d42afdf83c802629cb18e71b92a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86dd504a6cb1b491b9306e87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46c203e08ee64dda5507916e97e364a579280d5df6f82c856df6d771b5c8bee3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4756db939f3fb0bc9715dc23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "理论课吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76b6d57fbf4e19d8e5e5775d253ac1dc9dc5e2cb0008497a2d0caed6425449fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c1cb1914ecb8628c6e2dac6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88b08a445830f60f831cc69715bfe607a664dd20f0eb7a6b5add5663dfe83b11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb4e243157036411e61150d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25494e0ac35a5d9a33a3e3fc26b271c9b18f36d94b7fa445ba75b0fd858609be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de91bbf9783385b3a1b8a6d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0e503174d4061b5a441fdf881cb3104cb5ae97793c7d54f43b96980f665783a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:755d68d70383652e1bae22dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大海啊……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9621d39b7c59161d747eb39b928d6430993ae6f9c90aee43c1a8a10a7eb7a692",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfa079a45db3af863aeb467d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢你，为我指明道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe362ae48d7efa05e6ac7e070020048db0a667b3daa19f66db2f7fbd6ed24cfb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1ae2a45a41ac1d2790cdfbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你，陪我走到这里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d50daff362f4a18cc3a1a8813ed875f0c398581cdefee70ee5a6d3acc12d584",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1a14e9ac90c5203b74a6aad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "稍微狂野一点――",
      "source_fingerprint": "30983c6df932ecf721e69a0b3070ab81f54b61558f74a7531bbe8c698ca3489e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a1bfe10061a740a327b2974",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "――出发。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c963e152abff7e182db29d21b6dd64d75a237557c55784c43388e18d8c803d5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed2ab2ff27627c105decaea9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "狂野地，前进――",
      "source_fingerprint": "89db2fb30b6bbc2ced11a77be8876453c006df809085aeb26bca93a3d2563269",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f56a53fcaf5ffc7519dba435",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你，陪我走到这里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d50daff362f4a18cc3a1a8813ed875f0c398581cdefee70ee5a6d3acc12d584",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3acaded8cf60eb31ee87855",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为家族的一员，\r\n交出足以自豪的成绩。\r\n向这沸腾的，血脉起誓――",
      "source_fingerprint": "8279736709c7ad474f9424e7c12b3598ba27049f38ca4e864f0efe5d961f3783",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49231fb7861a1e9fb32e5dcd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "狂野地，激烈地――\r\n随着高昂的心跳，出发。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da5857acc5e53bccde2da78049b674e2bb48a64bd2b9b0b0ed2319e964c50ffb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b0f98ac575bde43221422be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你，陪我走到这里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d50daff362f4a18cc3a1a8813ed875f0c398581cdefee70ee5a6d3acc12d584",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d2c82b8807c5a1211188bb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46c203e08ee64dda5507916e97e364a579280d5df6f82c856df6d771b5c8bee3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a4d09f16dff91b0a285d974",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……没能追上……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6d5cff762cb12c1bd98f4ec6a751c92395f8a4f41942fbe4051c4f4f6e4c570",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3d98a44d9cd6fc0515bfcc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……唔，实力不够吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4832d290a2ee8fade8ca83ad300f0d1e6ab0634475471c5729b010636e2bd940",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:514b040bf678d17d914959ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "入围，已是极限了……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2abf4132f3729645ce282f481e30c0352d4cf5a1573484d4617f468b6277167",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f63a5f65e590ebbbf79c92f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "离最强，还差得远……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a571e7bf10dcf0f47cf7288ec3e89273f6345cccc4e80eee2dd5086c5ce8a62b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d323075f2994af046495ab6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所有人都深信不疑。\r\n这，就是所谓“最强”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b348a2e5cbf5611ec5d4b88c9a5deb9ee935425b8d2d829f42a52e5688e12f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:693dd6040968922db5ad086e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "展现最强――因此，是理所当然的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "933baa002295d8ddb6c67887d166fe12b43aa95e7d51b71eb64dbfe22ede6612",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06aac3db1c891c8be41d6c43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽情烙印在眼底吧，将这高贵的“最强”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03571132e5ae1b86929516b3f9388f5540410e91dd5422830ec244acbe2900c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07aa352d3f79c977deeb5c57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "旨在展现最强――因此，这是理所当然的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8b6d9f8b18bb4872c4504da68e3ac7673ec26721fbc2e9ba0bc4b284618c7e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57a2cd4b84bf7b5715cbbc14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "――“压倒性”地……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90a176624d2c7b350277108046458eceff5b6b6245f3a223f2712456851f3ec1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeffce766cd93f6df3f139e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "此刻，贯彻――最强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bd22d487adc4395e312d608cd3678b353149a6750cd89e955f57956dcf4ff8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfda3b598d45dcaa9ae22307",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "展现最强……。\r\n即使是『回应粉丝』，也一样。\r\n这就是我的使命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2fb0da3878755b35f9732f7cb40d94283e23283c0502589c3fe86a818470c66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df90104b7a550fe61c264cd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在大自然区域徒步旅行，在大海里\n远泳……  真想把这次假期过成\n名副其实的度假胜地式的理想假期。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab8f445192fee5c29b58dcfff89b7d7b309a745046486f0ddf8a2ae4d480e98c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc019b6f5b2e02aeab8b723f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "骏逸说要为心境的变化而添置新泳衣\n真有趣……如果能一起去的话，\n说不定能学到些什么呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52f4b42f6aa35cc31253c700f5d3b1b323ed12e6e2cb8da8871e6ef7d2388c9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb214a8fd5a99ae1d1c424e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每个人，都是某个人的……。父亲和\r\n祖父一定也曾如此……。\r\n总有一天要仔细问问。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ac0b5ee1da9b078b69ce4f3194bc0ce3f01f508f49df17935931a1990eaf8be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06ea2582f45d945c486d73dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "继承先辈们记忆的，荣耀结晶。\r\n此刻证明――我的双腿，我的力量！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c5fb9b2b3810d484c64a9dc9e5cc2abdbae4a64a5ddaf91a59f3a8c4e5188aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5d4bee1d592e4abb96e5aff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是活动任务。如果需要\r\n帮助的话请别客气。\r\n对我而言这也算是一种训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c946f4a4d13adf2fe5ecbca96b340eec41a3ad6d61ed77e0dc96c60dba99d0e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da452db0a51434b55a338e47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务奖励……这是努力的证明，\r\n也可说是迈向最强所留下的蹄迹。\r\n让我们逐一好好体味吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf3c1b5ff901ce3bccc8887155517b8f7ace0099ce7c508de5eaaff0c222879e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:148a37e0c70170a2f16aa4ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "擦亮眼睛看好了，见识“最强”吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d352b7dcf08a0cf87b5c9a1f1b3dc5c2746e2c935b0059ddb3f79134e01a0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6443d69301d25600aeb057d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是谁，都无法阻止我。\r\n看好了！――我才是，“最强”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "485b39a2f1d6e19217acf46f17986505fb9b2410b80b925599383c33359b0b9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df01af82f201e54acdcbd5a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个VR温泉乒乓球……  \n居然还要计算球台的磨损来决定战术……  \n如果还有机会的话，我会征服世界。",
      "source_fingerprint": "846fbb9e8f4b1e8e2844757b35f0ea573930a54bae0a696c65d53dd6056366f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "400113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34ff1ded7ee506a0d23af5c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "模拟店，绝对要办得红红火火才行。\r\n说到人气兴旺……甜点、拉面……\r\n唔，还有……小熊猫……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4270570c6940d6cc086cf10937e0df8131355a1738cb6253ce6016871a6a83c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "400144"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a1c77c3994446059454c4f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸引观众的演技，我已经渐渐掌握要领了。\r\n对于每晚陪我练习的皇冠，\r\n真得好好感谢她才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8f0ac618ce94971ecbafc6b653431a4eb857be90947e7dd6cf9373d832b29de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "400145"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0df4760177a8b63538423835",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夺取胜利――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82049353eca0dfc1f90b7925b12b6ab1eb8440f3967059bd0a11fb6399279dab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35aa47c4eecd477d3c33e4f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好",
      "source_fingerprint": "38e5b024a6d4fff93f5a86e41e91065c440b46d95dc7fd0c6b88acded45a0ca3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e56f4564916de0a3dad9bd77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好",
      "source_fingerprint": "f867f34178594f891eb70a4260f62b1d9289cfa60394f9fee1cbbe4a8b4bf436",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "410002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c07f402c6e662792c46f3c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好",
      "source_fingerprint": "f867f34178594f891eb70a4260f62b1d9289cfa60394f9fee1cbbe4a8b4bf436",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "410003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cf3dee7f0ef97ca399ca760",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f21bed79927e5236d335292545e9ebd0f5f41ee49249a49856519a27ee9095c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "410004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c27d42c0d3d16a36230c8a9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f21bed79927e5236d335292545e9ebd0f5f41ee49249a49856519a27ee9095c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "410005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a789256425f1329760b98312",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dfb96d163733959e5250b066fab803d16c85e8be2ca2413aca9f44e91be5c0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "410006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a75e4fdb8ae1f66b7c21f74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dfb96d163733959e5250b066fab803d16c85e8be2ca2413aca9f44e91be5c0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "410007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0df8f4db17d6a52f0b5b3647",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dfb96d163733959e5250b066fab803d16c85e8be2ca2413aca9f44e91be5c0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "410008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1faf808ed450456ef91b50ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "威风堂堂，如最强者一般。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a91303ac1f5a3cfc33b91f0a52183021a1d168569f7fba5f6bd902f4e4ac8e36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:368017a2eea740dc4d669bd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会完美完成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06d9b0d969904d7762af8b8d8e8fced1a75ee3db4e6346d9bfe2cb158bebb060",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c5adca8617fb2e5dcf4e0ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "证明，“最强”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4eb8e1fde1792fc62f5d6f58523e6832cfbef8cf056f98f2e237021867d3a072",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03caa891c8d1e84610ea7544",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "――还是，会紧张。\r\n不过，不会再给自己过多压力。\r\n谢谢你让我意识到这一点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a23c4fda893fd25544b9950d2fd234abf20051d7792584dfd2793913c84101d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8abd643235352e2f70c7fb93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣装要端正，清洁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43fd15aef5fe941325d7195adce0c4e251743cde8ff89be560ede35606a213bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cbd48916351cde4ff8aca0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "表演已准备周全。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb8df53f833fc03125885f5fb6840070cddbdc92b41eb84962c2ab16d34f45c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa5d84e1a44fcd461e958905",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如这份决意一般，\r\n身披坚定不移的黑色――出发！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c944d588bc8775801f41bf17970fccfca41988d7ae64bc79fb3d0e60fcf17b0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9ae02a981fbce94b53a2565",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽好学生的本分。\r\n文武双全，完美地――",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ab39c950aa4d79d0556960504be57aaec1a9bc1096b075ea468579609127f5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93b16a591f3ab0b9047e59a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舞台也是一种团体竞技――\r\n看着统一的衣装，就会这么想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cab140a4a2c1c2b52e63b85b0e97c9e4a9346abb75f61e16a35e837d0a474b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afa9af60e4dc883458fbf01f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "展现“最强”。\r\n血脉的证明，就在此……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "055526574b975bb81ce75e1a042766677ccd8e8d4b4d6b6f3ef35e7f274a5e43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43a8022a430cc80ba4f16fed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为最强者堂堂正正、高贵地存在吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4855ddb6e76d5df4655d96c2189c1267cb34122e85ee84e5810ce0040f14e643",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c119f35d59b3616fd746a7ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我明白，品格是自然而然流露出来的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9ed287dc90593863dfa3508928deae027caa3da1b0f0188587755ef26a58f37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa45db8a1e518d338c274bdb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还有这样的衣服啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72980ab1493db3e2ce5f14faec482b4affff65ebdd7ccf206e1a5791f305337e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef93e58d41211025a177827f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论何时，都想穿着与场合相称的衣装。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e93cab4ddcd31eb368ef4d5f49407c5f15b6a2aa593f51a3eb83c53426ae7e49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb00f8d06c9faf9cbc9983c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这家厂商的衣服穿起来很舒服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b06a77df0f229019b841e4d1c867f6fcfa200636a103bfdd960bb3af15bc9269",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5a72f5af702468d49f027c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "裤子要买长一点的……  \n因为裤腿很快就会变短。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9a0b3d5dc31a04053f40ccd27516d7118bc20bfe5b64380141fcc365a14f6ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80545fbd8a88e40a01bd181b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣装要端正，清洁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43fd15aef5fe941325d7195adce0c4e251743cde8ff89be560ede35606a213bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aef4293f8fba8c96b26987ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "表演已准备周全。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb8df53f833fc03125885f5fb6840070cddbdc92b41eb84962c2ab16d34f45c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf4144c223451d627455b8b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如这份决意一般，\r\n身披坚定不移的黑色――出发！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c944d588bc8775801f41bf17970fccfca41988d7ae64bc79fb3d0e60fcf17b0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
